  "title": "Contract Chaos? How to Centralize Every Agreement Across Email, Google Drive, and DocuSign",
  "summary": "Tired of contracts buried in inboxes, Google Drive, or DocuSign accounts? This guide walks you through how to manually find every signed agreement across your business—and how to centralize them into a single, organized repository. Whether you’re prepping for a fundraising round, an audit, or just trying to avoid auto-renewal nightmares, this step-by-step process will help you regain control. Plus, learn why a solution like Docsum can save hours and reduce risk.",
